"P922150753" "<t=8 caption x= 0.3 y= 0.4 d=7><scale 1.75><Color black><bgcolor white>This beast of metal MUST be the work of the Titans, left to sow ruin and sorrow upon the world! AND! He's a coliseum exclusive, folks!"
