"P3423654888" "<t=3 caption x=0.3 y=0.5 d=5><scale 1.75><Color GoldenRod><bgcolor darkolivegreen>Hacker: Proceed to the Server Room, first door on the left. Use your stealth to bypass the guards and hack the servers."
// Generic String :
"P1866475935" "<t=3 caption x=0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><Color White><BGcolor SlateGray>Hitter: Head to the Generator Room, first door on the right. Disable the generators you find there."
// Generic String :
"P1120672088" "<t=3 caption x=0.7 y=0.5 d=5><scale 1.75><Color Red><bgcolor black>Thief: Search through the desks and cabinets in Ted Dubois' office to find the Key, the Radio, the Recorder and the Ring."
// Generic String :
"P1650843274" "<t=3 caption x=0.7 y=0.5 d=5><scale 1.75><color black><bgcolor IndianRed>Grifter: Talk with Sylvia Rexson and attempt to distract and stall her by any means necessary."
// Say String :
"P204604374" "<em Laugh>Don't try to flash me your charm. I'm not interested. Now, would you please leave me alone?"
// Generic String :
"P2745888835" "<t=4 caption x=0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color black><bgcolor IndianRed>Sylvia ignores you and doesn't seem the least distracted."
// Generic String :
"P2426821141" "<t=3 caption x=0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color black><bgcolor IndianRed>Try talking to Sylvia again."
// Say String :
"P77998548" "<em Frustrated>Tha-That's absolutely disgusting! I swear if we weren't in public, I'd rip your throat out, right here, right now!"
// Generic String :
"P272697709" "<t=4 caption x=0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color black><bgcolor IndianRed>Sylvia appears somewhat distracted by your unorthodox display."
// Say String :
"P756843427" "<em laugh>Oh please, you obviously don't know who you are talking to."
// Say String :
"P3583136895" "Get out of here before I have you thrown out, or worse, take matters into my own hands."
// Generic String :
"P3315459957" "<t=3 caption x=0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color black><bgcolor IndianRed>Sylvia does not appear to be even slightly interested in what you have to say. You have failed in your attempt at distraction!"
// Say String :
"P476365081" "You're joking, right? Excuse me, while I call security."
// Generic String :
"P20006912" "<t=3 caption x=0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color black><bgcolor IndianRed>Sylvia does not appear to be even slightly interested in what you have to say. You have failed in your attempt at distraction and security is about to throw you out!"
// Say String :
"P2969063419" "<em frustrated>You're just the most disgusting person!"
// Say String :
"P3077507814" "If I see you around here again, you're dead!"
// Generic String :
"P3525195836" "<t=3 caption x=0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color black><bgcolor IndianRed>You've managed to wierd Sylvia out to the point where she totally forgot what she was doing and she stormed off in a haze of anger and frustration. Good job!"
// Say String :
"P4123040349" "<em hand>You have a terrible sense of humor."
// Say String :
"P3432954961" "<em laugh>You're just lucky I don't have enough time to personally throw you out of here."
// Say String :
"P2906589965" "Now, if you'd excuse me."
// Generic String :
"P1618629156" "<t=3 caption x=0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color black><bgcolor IndianRed>You were marginally successful in delaying Sylvia."
// Say String :
"P1207135602" "<em hand>Don't mention it. Now stop bothering me."
// Generic String :
"P1046792714" "<t=3 caption x=0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color black><bgcolor IndianRed>You have failed at distracting Sylvia."
// Say String :
"P1593069050" "There-there. Now get lost."
// Say String :
"P1143370057" "<em frustrated>No! Oh your tears are getting everywhere! I don't need this all over my dress!"
// Say String :
"P4229042153" "Seriously! Stop already! Yo-you're pathetic, you know that?!"
// Say String :
"P3077263663" "<em frustrated>Oh great, I don't even want to know what this is on my dress, you slobbering fool! I'll have to go to the bathroom to clean this off!"
// Generic String :
"P407699565" "<t=3 caption x=0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color black><bgcolor IndianRed>It will take Sylvia a good while to compose herself after the spray-down you just gave her. Gross but very effective!"
// Say String :
"P1361463792" "Alright, let's get to the bottom of this..."
// Say String :
"P2886457841" "Hrm. No answer. Look, I'm a busy woman and don't have time for this run-around. Come back when you have your credentials"
// Generic String :
"P1737246600" "<t=7 caption X=0.7 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color black><bgcolor IndianRed>After a few moments waiting for a response, Sylvia gives up waiting and has clearly lost interest in anything you have to say."
// Say String :
"P3951086828" "Hi there, this is Sylvia Rexson over at Tyrant's Palace. I've got one of your people over here but they forgot to bring their ID badge or any form of identification."
// Generic String :
"P3254704006" "<t=7 caption X=0.7 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color black><bgcolor GoldenRod>Hi there, this is Sylvia Rexson over at Tyrant's Palace. I've got one of your people over here but they forgot to bring their ID badge or any form of identification."
// Say String :
"P424551612" "Well, I suppose that checks out. Although I do have to say it's a pretty careless thing to do. Your people should be more fastidious."
// Generic String :
"P1103208703" "<t=7 caption X=0.7 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color black><bgcolor GoldenRod>Well, I suppose that checks out. Although I do have to say it's a pretty careless thing to do. Your people should be more fastidious. I have better things to do than babysit every amateur you send my way and I should not have to waste my time calling you."
// Say String :
"P1643300405" "I have better things to do than babysit every amateur you send my way and I should not have to waste my time calling you."
// Say String :
"P2166533347" "In any case, thank you very much for your time."
// Generic String :
"P488878873" "<t=7 caption X=0.7 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color black><bgcolor GoldenRod>In any case, thank you very much for your time."
// Say String :
"P4032681397" "Alright, that checks out.  Let's get down to business."
