"P1453218117" "<t=3 caption x=0.7 y=0.5 d=5><scale 1.75><Color Red><bgcolor black>Thief: Enter the vent in the Ventilation room. From there, avoid the security lasers and make your way to the Vault. Once the Grifter has completed their task, you will be able to open the vault!"
// Generic String :
"P751206252" "<t=3 caption x=0.7 y=0.5 d=5><scale 1.75><color black><bgcolor IndianRed>Grifter: Talk to Ted Dubois and get him to say the following words: 'The Price of Freedom is Eternal Vigilance.' Once he says each word, the Thief can splice them together to get the passphrase for the vault!"
// Say String :
"P2318333730" "Well, naturally, Tyrant's Palace cost an astronomical sum to construct."
// Say String :
"P481439987" "The structure itself is mammoth and the interior needed to match the opulence and luxury associated with the Casino's namesake."
// Say String :
"P2601062893" "With our funding, though, we had the freedom to create a beautiful facility that spoke to the eternal grandeur of the emperor."
// Generic String :
"P898375246" "<t=4 caption x=0.7 y=0.4 d=5><scale 1.75><color black><bgcolor IndianRed>Ted appears ready for your next question."
// Say String :
"P1776535609" "Well, because we cater exclusively to the wealthiest of clientele, we occasionally get some truly famous individuals."
// Say String :
"P1631346360" "Naturally, we cater to these individuals - It truly is the number one location for the Emperor's Praetors."
// Say String :
"P3303524824" "When they are not maintaining peace through their constant vigilance, the powerful come here to play."
// Say String :
"P3435751692" "As you well know, we are a world-class hotel and casino, complete with all the ammenities you would expect."
// Say String :
"P1233332175" "It's not the normal ammenities of Tyrant's Palace that makes it so unique, but rather how we cater to the unique and specifc tastes of our patrons."
// Say String :
"P2657131162" "Virtually anything is available within the luxurious privacy of the Casino, for a price, of course."
// Say String :
"P4132767882" "As you can imagine, an impressive amount of money is regularly in motion on the gaming floor."
// Say String :
"P3593218446" "Naturally, that requires a certain amount of vigilance on our part."
// Say String :
"P3199217624" "I can assure you though, with our high-tech security, Tyrant's Place is one of the safest locations on Earth."
// Say String :
"P3474108214" "Well, our security makes such transgressions as theft or cheating virtually impossible..."
// Say String :
"P994618593" "Of course, thieves and criminals are not always the smartest individuals and they try anyway."
// Say String :
"P3691689842" "Con-men, thieves and card counters - I extract the 'Price' from all of them."
// Say String :
"P2750938641" "We vet our patrons carefully and are aware of everyone in our Casino at all times."
// Say String :
"P1800553653" "Thanks to an 'arrangement' with local authorities, we have the freedom to do as we please to individuals causing trouble."
// Say String :
"P1093875891" "Of course, when it comes to running a gambling establishment, the threat of theft and grift are eternal."
// Say String :
"P3558425755" "Of course, most of our elderly clientele are not interested in the more exotic services we offer."
// Say String :
"P1684369873" "Price is often an issue and we offer certain deals to attract them and their precious pensions to our tables."
// Say String :
"P266750776" "As chief of security, I can assure you that we closely watch those who enter the Tyrant's Palace."
// Say String :
"P1596536915" "Often, the elderly are targets of grifters and thieves and that is something we simply cannot allow."
// Say String :
"P4053473924" "Our vigilance protects your readers from criminals and con-artists."
// Say String :
"P1979832703" "Well, we have a variety of special jackpots and lotteries that have particularly high payouts."
// Say String :
"P525917902" "Of course, these are rarely won, but I can assure you, lives have changed on the floor of the game room."
// Say String :
"P1763947769" "Of particular note: the 'Eternal Payout' jackpot offers wealth and freedom for longer than anyone could live!"
// Generic String :
