"P9438930" "<t=3 caption X=0.7 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor SlateGray>Talk to 'The High Roller' again."
// Say String :
"P3125028869" "Alright, Senpai! Watch as your Kohai goes all Bushido on this establishment!"
// Say String :
"P897523145" "Mind if I join you guys?"
// Say String :
"P2313152110" "The game is Blackjack, gentlemen..."
// Generic String :
"P266105714" "<t=5 caption X=0.6 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor SlateGray>A Few Hands Later..."
// Say String :
"P1122246483" "Gentlemen, please place your bets!"
// Say String :
"P2625167529" "All in."
// Say String :
"P692296588" "Wha-uh... I mean, All in. Too."
// Say String :
"P2195841220" "You sure about that son? I think I gave a warning to you last time I saw you in here trying to cheat the house."
// Say String :
"P3950793342" "Oh! Jimmy! I-uh didn't see you there. I swear, I wasn't counting cards. Not this time at least. Honest! Please don't break my knuckles!"
// Generic String :
"P3812630412" "<t=5 caption X=0.7 y=0.4 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor SlateGray>That did not go so well..."
// Generic String :
"P1530764374" "<t=5 caption X=0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor SlateGray>Talk to 'The Honest-Looking Professional' again."
// Say String :
"P1602871304" "Well, let's take this for a spin and learn how good I am at this!"
// Say String :
"P3510792947" "Mind another player, gentlemen?"
// Say String :
"P248723369" "The game is Blackjack, ladies and gentlemen..."
// Say String :
"P713512635" "Please place your bets!"
// Say String :
"P4265356412" "The little lady has cleaned me out! Fold."
// Say String :
"P1389848760" "'Little lady', eh? I'm in."
// Say String :
"P3081306315" "Everything on the up and up, over there?"
// Say String :
"P127681264" "Mr. Crescendo? Yes, everything seems fine."
// Generic String :
"P2716500401" "<t=5 caption X=0.7 y=0.4 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor SlateGray>Not perfect, but well enough!"
// Generic String :
"P1728784093" "<t=5 caption X=0.7 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor SlateGray>Talk to 'The Disheveled Drifter' again."
// Say String :
"P3298372632" "Time for sweet sweet revenge!"
